-------------------------------------------------------------------
Thu Oct 08 2026 - krism

- Update to 5.7.1.
- Fix capability token persistence: keep toolchain_hash a 64-hex SHA256 value.
- Fix malformed make_plan branch around the empty RPM-cache guard.
- Allow revalidated through the state gate so interrupted PREPARED -> REVALIDATED
  transactions can safely return to PREPARED and revalidate again.
- Refresh repository metadata during REVALIDATED and reject stale plans before
  opening any TARGET.
- Permit typed abort of an unrecorded TARGET only when exact description/TXID
  ownership resolves uniquely to the requested snapshot.
- Align the design contract with the intentionally hybrid 5.6.1 + 5.7.1
  implementation.
- Preserve the v5 state/cache namespace so a 5.6.1 pending-reboot transaction
  remains confirmable after the updater package itself is upgraded.
- Add durable PREPARED -> REVALIDATED barrier before tukit open.
- Replace exact help/version hashing with semantic capability checks.
- Add typed needs-inspection outcomes for ambiguous open/close/abort states.
- Require TARGET quiescence before automatic abort.
- Treat tukit close timeout/failure as ambiguous; never blind-abort afterwards.
- Move TARGET boot cleanup behind a verified abort.
- Add typed recovery inspect/abort-target/adopt-target/clear-opening commands.
- Keep strict manifest, critical-package, bootability and purge-kernels checks.
- Add procps runtime dependency for quiescence inspection and keep diffutils
  for cmp.
- No timer, daemon or unattended scheduler.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Sep 29 2026 - krism

- Keep guarded updater at 5.6.1.
- Add missing diffutils runtime dependency for cmp.
- Keep updater manual: no timer, daemon or unattended scheduling.
